config HEALTH_MONITOR
	bool "Opt-in Health Monitor core"
	default n
	depends on !SMP || ARCH_CHIP_AMEBASMART
	depends on !SCHED_TICKLESS && !SCHED_TICKSUPPRESS
	depends on !APP_BINARY_SEPARATION
	depends on !SUPPRESS_INTERRUPTS && !SUPPRESS_TIMER_INTS
	help
		Self-only non-blocking start/stop/kick with a CPU0 lazy heap.
		SMP uses single-writer publication and per-CPU bounded queues;
		no atomic API, exclusive instructions or shared locks. Requires
		coherent amebasmart RAM and real periodic CPU0 ticks. No automatic
		registrations or hardware watchdog provisioning. See
		docs/health_monitor.md for queue errors and publication limits.
